    <!-- The app's own display name — launcher label, "Set as default" picker, etc. Deliberately
         NOT a plain generic word like "Phone": build-2 QA (N1) found that collided with the
         system dialer's own "Phone" entry in the default-app picker, with no way to tell them
         apart. Keyword-aligned with the package name (callerid.callblocker.spamcall...) rather
         than a made-up brand, per the existing global-keyword Play Store strategy. -->
